  "sourceTitle": "Qwen3.8-27B has the best coding ceiling you can run at home on consumer hardware, it ships with reasoning_effort defaulting to xhigh - I measured what that costs",
  "sourceBodyHash": "780cbf1107caf0df56ee3d753dbf83c82437621e27ffdf9271ae138c9feda4d8",
